/20 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-4\">👑</div><h3 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 font-headline text-lg font-bold text-white mb-5\">Creator</h3><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mb-5 min-h-[80px]\"><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-end gap-1 leading-none\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-xl font-semibold text-white/70 mt-1\">₹</span><span data-price-plan=\"creator\" class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">99</span></div><span data-period=\"/month\" class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-sm text-white/70\">/month</span><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 min-h-[22px]\"><span data-savings-plan=\"creator\" style=\"visibility:hidden\" class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-xs font-semibold bg-white/20 text-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full\">–</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 h-px bg-white/20 mb-5\"></div><ul class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex flex-col gap-2.5 flex-1 mb-6 text-sm text-white\"><li class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 w-5 h-5 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold bg-white/20 text-white\">✓</span><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-white\">50 credits</span></li><li class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 w-5 h-5 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold bg-white/20 text-white\">✓</span><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-white\">100 websites</span></li><li class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 w-5 h-5 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold bg-white/20 text-white\">✓</span><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-white\">5GB image upload</span></li><li class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 w-5 h-5 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold bg-white/20 text-white\">✓</span><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-white\">Priority email support</span></li><li class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 w-5 h-5 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-600\">★</span><span class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-white\">Live chat included</span></li></ul><a class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-white text-[#78555e] hover:bg-[#faf6f8] transition-all text-center block font-bold\" href=\"/digital-greeting/pricing\">Choose Creator</a></div></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-8 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#78555e] hover:text-[#c64b7a] transition-colors\" href=\"/digital-greeting/pricing\">View full pricing details &amp; billing options <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><section class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mx-auto mt-16 w-full max-w-4xl px-4 md:px-8 mb-16\"><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 text-center mb-10\"><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 l4u-kicker\">Got Questions?</p><h2 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#1a1c1d]\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 space-y-4\"><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 rounded-[1.4rem] p-6 bg-white/65 border border-[#78555e]/10 backdrop-blur-md\"><h3 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 font-headline text-lg font-bold text-[#78555e]\">Is MsgReplier Wishes free to use?</h3><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 text-sm text-[#817476] leading-relaxed\">Yes! You can start for free and create up to 12 digital wishes websites with our Free plan. We also offer premium plans with more credits and exclusive features if you need them.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 rounded-[1.4rem] p-6 bg-white/65 border border-[#78555e]/10 backdrop-blur-md\"><h3 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 font-headline text-lg font-bold text-[#78555e]\">How do I share the wishes website with my loved one?</h3><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 text-sm text-[#817476] leading-relaxed\">Once you customize and publish your digital greeting, you&#x27;ll receive a unique link. You can easily copy and share this link via WhatsApp, Instagram, SMS, or any other messaging app.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 rounded-[1.4rem] p-6 bg-white/65 border border-[#78555e]/10 backdrop-blur-md\"><h3 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 font-headline text-lg font-bold text-[#78555e]\">Can I add my own music and photos?</h3><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 text-sm text-[#817476] leading-relaxed\">Absolutely! Our builder allows you to upload your own photos for the galleries and add YouTube links to play custom background music, making your wish truly personal and magical.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 rounded-[1.4rem] p-6 bg-white/65 border border-[#78555e]/10 backdrop-blur-md\"><h3 class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 font-headline text-lg font-bold text-[#78555e]\">Are the digital wishes websites private?</h3><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-2 text-sm text-[#817476] leading-relaxed\">Yes, you have full control over privacy. You can choose to PIN-protect your digital wishes websites so that only the intended recipient with the code can view your surprise.</p></div></div></section><footer class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mt-24 border-t border-[#78555e]/15 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 pb-8 pt-8 md:px-8\"><div class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18 flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-[#817476] md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><p class=\"jsx-56a86366069a1d18\">